# Bog -- FrogComposBand's own palette.
#
# Green-black canvas, moss and amber, warm where Slate is cool. The colour
# families are exactly where the game put them: retinting is allowed, moving a
# colour is not, because a red 'D' has to stay a different dragon from a blue
# one no matter what theme you are wearing.

name    Bog
blurb   Green-black and amber. Frog's own.

# --- interface roles -------------------------------------------------------
ui      canvas      0A0F0C
ui      panel       17231A
ui      border      3A5240
ui      title       D9A441
ui      text        E4EADF
ui      muted       8A9A88
ui      accent      7FC46B
ui      selection   2E4A30  D8

